/-!
# Installer's contract for C2 general E

One **particular** Course, upgraded by supplier; pre-reset comparison at predictive
βp even when not sure of positivity of incoming vacuum. Simultaneous receipt
for mask and logarithm Budget. Path.p and Model.Seed keep always. Inputs may be
unpacked, notably with arbitrary unmarked K in bounds and old E in admissible
range. Preparing using `Filing.decoration` as legal EXACT normalization.

This Σv is the one where all Mark step comparisons will now be made. This
ΣU Decoration should not be used for ANY part of selecting a Coupling Path,
which is the true unmodified Run and sold in #Campaign. Keep laws of
Census.Layout.Room true for all test θ o. Authority.Computes Claime.
-/
